<sup>1</sup>
</xref><role content-type="http://credit.niso.org/contributor-roles/data-curation/">Data curation</role><role content-type="http://credit.niso.org/contributor-roles/formal-analysis/">Formal Analysis</role><role content-type="http://credit.niso.org/contributor-roles/methodology/">Methodology</role><role content-type="http://credit.niso.org/contributor-roles/supervision/">Supervision</role><role content-type="http://credit.niso.org/contributor-roles/writing-original-draft/">Writing &#x02013; original draft</role></contrib><aff id="aff1">
<label>1</label>University of Health Sciences, Bursa Yuksek Ihtisas Training and Research Hospital, Department of Obstetrics and Gynecology &#x02013; Bursa, Turkey.</aff></contrib-group><author-notes><corresp id="c1">
